==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Mr. Puffington]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 96.67~100 seconds<sup>2,900f~3,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 53.33~63.33 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,900f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to nuke the first Puffington with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] to get it out of the way fast, while making sure Celeboodle doesn't interfere by using units like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]]. [[Supercar Cat]] can then deal enormous amounts of damage to Fallen Bear, or, if one lacks it, a Shield Piercer like [[Cat Researcher]] and a strong backliner. Repeat this for the second Puffington and Fallen Bear and you should win.

On higher difficulty clears of this stage, [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] demolish this stage.

